# __PROJECT_NAME__

A jayzee app project. The engine is the `jayzee` npm dependency in `package.json`, and this directory holds the app code.

## Layout

- `apps/__PROJECT_NAME__/index.js`: the starter app for the template you chose.
- `package.json`: the project name and the jayzee version it was created for.

## Add another app project

Run `npx jayzee-create-app --template simple my-next-app` in the directory that holds this project to create `my-next-app/`.
